---
/**
 * HeroBlobs, decorative blurred brand blobs for hero depth (matches HomeHero).
 * Render inside a `relative overflow-hidden` hero section, BEFORE the content
 * (which should carry `relative` so it sits above). Purely decorative.
 */
---
<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-coral-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-32 -left-24 w-96 h-96 bg-teal-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-40"></div>
</div>
